106, \"end\": 259, \"text\": \"The band consists of five members: founding vocalist Chris Barnes, guitarists Ray Suhy and Jack Owen, bassist Jeff Hughell and drummer Marco Pitruzzella.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d01\", \"start\": 260, \"end\": 439, \"text\": \"It was originally a side project formed by Barnes with guitarist Allen West of Obituary, but became a full-time commitment after Barnes was dismissed from Cannibal Corpse in 1995.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d01\", \"start\": 440, \"end\": 614, \"text\": \"They have released twelve albums, and are listed by Nielsen Soundscan as the fourth best-selling death metal act in the U.S., with album sales over 370,000 (sales numbers are\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 100, \"text\": \"Amazon.in Enter the characters you see below Sorry , we just need to make sure you 're not a robot .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d02\", \"start\": 101, \"end\": 172, \"text\": \"For best results , please make sure your browser is accepting cookies .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d02\", \"start\": 173, \"end\": 326, \"text\": \"Type the characters you see in this image : Try different image Continue shopping Conditions of Use & Sale Privacy Notice © 1996-2015 , Amazon.com , Inc.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d02\", \"start\": 327, \"end\": 344, \"text\": \"or its affiliates\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Six Feet Under\", \"scope\": \"genre\", \"claim\": \"The genre of \\\"Six Feet Under\\\" is a neo-noir thriller.\", \"answer\": \"neo-noir thriller\", \"quote\": \"Manorama Six Feet Under Manorama Six Feet Unde